# Close-out D4 (open decision 11): a succeeded, failed or cancelled job never changes status again. The fault removes the trigger (its CREATE TRIGGER and its COMMENT ON TRIGGER) from platform_0007; a succeeded job then moves back to draft and the test must say so.
GATE=terminal-final
TARGET=platform
SETUP=
STEP=go test TestCloseout_TerminalSucceededIsFinal (database integration test, real Postgres)
CMD=H_PG_ADMIN_DSN="$FAULT_ADMIN_DSN" bash tests/harness/run-db-tests.sh '^TestCloseout_TerminalSucceededIsFinal$'
MESSAGE=--- FAIL: TestCloseout_TerminalSucceededIsFinal
MESSAGE=a succeeded job moved to draft: was ALLOWED
